# Escape claims over the phaser corpus; check.py in this directory documents
# what is asserted. The collector's mark budget is unlimited for the fixture and
# bootstrap and bounded (--budget) for p5 and phaser, the two big bundles, where
# each frame pop would otherwise cost a full mark.
# RUN: python3 %S/check.py --oracle ctcompile-test-type-oracle --claims ctcompile-test-escape-claims --script %{monorepo}/tools/check/escape-oracle.py --corpus %{monorepo}/ctbrowser/vendor/phaser/phaser.js --work %t --name phaser --budget 4
